WEBVTT

00:07:58.676 --> 00:08:01.476
There are experiences of free will,

00:08:01.516 --> 00:08:02.956
of intending to do something,

00:08:02.996 --> 00:08:05.076
or of being the cause
of things that happen.

00:08:05.716 --> 00:08:07.956
There are experiences
of perceiving the world

00:08:07.956 --> 00:08:11.596
from a particular perspective,
a first-person point of view.

00:08:12.356 --> 00:08:15.756
And then, there are deeply
embodied experiences,

00:08:15.756 --> 00:08:18.556
for instance of identifying
with an object in the world

00:08:18.596 --> 00:08:19.756
that is my body.

00:08:19.796 --> 00:08:21.956
These hands, they're my hands.

00:08:22.436 --> 00:08:25.116
And then, of emotion and mood.

00:08:25.156 --> 00:08:28.356
And at the deepest-lying,
most basal levels,

00:08:28.356 --> 00:08:32.516
experiences of simply being a living body,